Instead of completely killing the batch and forcing the Maker to upload the Excel file all over again, we will gracefully "catch" the final 5th failure, return the batch to the Pending ('P') queue, and ask the Checker to just click "Approve" again.
To make this twist happen, we must ensure we DO NOT release the VID. If we release the VID, the batch is dead. We want the batch to stay perfectly alive, just waiting in the queue again.
